{"seq":3,"slug":"trueskill-teams","title":"TrueSkill 与团队","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/rating/trueskill-teams","wordCount":1551,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"trueskill-与团队\">TrueSkill 与团队</h1><p>Elo 和 Glicko 都是为一对一设计的，可你打开任何一款现代多人游戏，看到的都是五打五、四十人混战、或多队混排。微软为 Xbox Live 设计 TrueSkill 时要回答的新问题是：当胜负只发生在「队」这个层级，怎么把功劳与责任公平地分摊回每个个体？它的答案是把每个人的技能建模成一个概率分布，用因子图把个体推断成团队、再从团队结果反推个体，这套机器至今仍是团队评级的标杆。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>TrueSkill 是微软为团队对局设计的评级系统，它把每个玩家的技能建模成一个正态分布，用均值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>（实力估计）与标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>（不确定性）刻画，对外则用保守折现 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu - k\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 展示（常取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span>）。它的精髓在于用因子图处理团队：假设一支队伍的总实力是成员技能之和，个体高斯相加得到团队高斯；把「哪队赢」当作对队间实力差的观测，再通过消息传递把这一观测反向传播回每个个体，更新各自的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>。这套推断天然支持多队混战与队内分摊。TrueSkill 长期受许可限制，催生了基于 Weng-Lin 研究的开源替代 OpenSkill——用逻辑斯蒂分布替代高斯近似，无许可限制且更快。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从点到分布-技能即高斯\">从点到分布：技能即高斯</h2><p>TrueSkill 给每个玩家的技能建一个正态分布，用两个参数刻画：均值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>（实力估计）与标准差 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>（不确定性）。这与 Glicko 的「评分+RD」思想同源——都把技能当作带误差棒的量。系统对外展示的常是一个保守估计，把不确定性折现：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R = \\mu - k\\,\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k=3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着「我有很高把握你至少有这么强」，新玩家 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 大所以展示分被压低，随着对局增多 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 收缩，展示分逐步逼近真实 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span>。这个保守折现也有匹配上的好处：它让新人不会因初始高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 就被丢进高手局。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>含义</th>\n<th>类比 Glicko</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>技能均值估计</td>\n<td>评分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">R</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>个体不确定性</td>\n<td>偏差 RD</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu - 3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>对外保守展示分</td>\n<td>（Glicko 无直接对应）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"因子图-把个体推断成团队\">因子图：把个体推断成团队</h2><p>TrueSkill 的精髓在于如何处理团队。它假设一支队伍的总实力是成员技能之和，于是个体的高斯分布相加得到团队的高斯分布；对局结果（哪队赢）则作为对「团队实力差」的观测，再通过消息传递（message passing）把这一观测反向传播回每个个体，更新各自的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[个体技能分布&lt;br/&gt;mu_i, sigma_i] --&gt; B[团队实力 = 成员之和]&#10;  B --&gt; C[队间实力差&lt;br/&gt;决定胜负概率]&#10;  C --&gt; D[观测到实际胜负]&#10;  D --&gt; E[反向消息传递&lt;br/&gt;更新每个个体]&#10;  E --&gt; F{个体 sigma 收缩}&#10;  F --&gt; A&#10;  C --&gt; G[该结果有多意外&lt;br/&gt;决定更新幅度]&#10;  G --&gt; E\">flowchart TD\n  A[个体技能分布&lt;br/&gt;mu_i, sigma_i] --&gt; B[团队实力 = 成员之和]\n  B --&gt; C[队间实力差&lt;br/&gt;决定胜负概率]\n  C --&gt; D[观测到实际胜负]\n  D --&gt; E[反向消息传递&lt;br/&gt;更新每个个体]\n  E --&gt; F{个体 sigma 收缩}\n  F --&gt; A\n  C --&gt; G[该结果有多意外&lt;br/&gt;决定更新幅度]\n  G --&gt; E</pre><p>这套因子图推断带来几个 Elo 做不到的能力：赢下一场「你方明显弱势」的对局，每个成员都涨得更多（结果更意外）；输给明显弱队，跌得更狠。它还能自然处理多于两队的混战，以及队内分摊——表现与队伍贡献不一致时，更新会有差异。微软后来的 TrueSkill 2 进一步把胜负之外的信号纳入：玩家经验、小队归属、击杀数、退游倾向、其它模式的水平。据微软研究院公布，TrueSkill 2 在预测历史对局结果上达到约 68% 准确率，而原始 TrueSkill 约为 52%——多榨取的信号显著提升了预测力，这也正是 <a href=\"elo-rating\">Elo 评级</a> 「只看胜负」局限的反面教材。</p>\n<h2 id=\"openskill-与-weng-lin-开源的替代\">OpenSkill 与 Weng-Lin：开源的替代</h2><p>TrueSkill 长期受专利与许可限制，催生了开源替代。基于 Weng 和 Lin 研究的 OpenSkill 解决同一类问题，但用逻辑斯蒂分布（Bradley-Terry 模型）替代 TrueSkill 的高斯近似，换来更简单、更快的计算——据 OpenSkill 的论文（arXiv 2401.05451，2024）与多个实现，它比 TrueSkill 快约 2.5 到 6.5 倍，某些 JavaScript 实现甚至快到 20 倍，而准确率与 TrueSkill 相当。它被用在火箭联盟等游戏中。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>系统</th>\n<th>分布模型</th>\n<th>多队/多人</th>\n<th>许可</th>\n<th>相对速度</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Elo</td>\n<td>逻辑斯蒂</td>\n<td>仅一对一</td>\n<td>公有</td>\n<td>极快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Glicko-2</td>\n<td>逻辑斯蒂</td>\n<td>一对一</td>\n<td>公有</td>\n<td>快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TrueSkill</td>\n<td>高斯因子图</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>TrueSkill 2</td>\n<td>高斯+附加信号</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>受限</td>\n<td>中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenSkill (Weng-Lin)</td>\n<td>逻辑斯蒂</td>\n<td>支持</td>\n<td>无限制</td>\n<td>快 (约 2.5-6.5x TrueSkill)</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>选型的实际逻辑：纯一对一且要简单，Elo/Glicko 足矣；要团队评级且不受许可困扰，OpenSkill 通常是 2026 年的默认推荐；只有当你需要榨取胜负之外的丰富信号、且能接受许可成本时，TrueSkill 2 才更有吸引力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"团队评级带来的匹配新难题\">团队评级带来的匹配新难题</h2><p>一旦评级到了团队层级，匹配就要处理新约束：怎么把不同评分的人组成势均力敌的两队、组队（party）里强弱悬殊该如何惩罚、角色位置如何兼顾。这些已经超出评级本身，属于把评分送进队列后的组局问题。个体评分如何聚合成「这一队多强」，以及由此带来的撮合，在 <a href=\"../matching/party-role-matching\">组队与角色匹配</a> 里展开；而评级不确定性如何转化为搜索范围，承接自上一篇 <a href=\"glicko-uncertainty\">Glicko 与不确定性</a>。换句话说，本篇产出「每个人、每支队多强且多确定」，匹配章负责拿它去真正成局。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>TrueSkill 把技能建模成高斯分布（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span></span></span></span></span> 均值、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 不确定性），对外用 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>μ</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>σ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mu - 3\\sigma</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">μ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">σ</span></span></span></span></span> 保守展示。</li>\n<li>因子图把个体相加成团队、用胜负观测反向更新个体，天然支持多队混战与队内分摊。</li>\n<li>TrueSkill 2 纳入胜负之外的信号，历史预测准确率从约 52% 提升到约 68%。</li>\n<li>OpenSkill（Weng-Lin）用逻辑斯蒂模型替代高斯，无许可限制、快 2.5-6.5 倍，是 2026 年团队评级的常见默认选择。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>团队评分如何送进队列并撮合成均势两队，见 <a href=\"../matching/party-role-matching\">组队与角色匹配</a>。</li>\n<li>个体不确定性建模的同源思想，见 <a href=\"glicko-uncertainty\">Glicko 与不确定性</a>。</li>\n<li>多人对局的状态同步与服务器架构，见 <a href=\"../../game-networking/mmo-architecture/server-cluster\">服务器集群</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"TrueSkill 与团队","id":"trueskill-与团队"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"从点到分布：技能即高斯","id":"从点到分布-技能即高斯"},{"level":2,"text":"因子图：把个体推断成团队","id":"因子图-把个体推断成团队"},{"level":2,"text":"OpenSkill 与 Weng-Lin：开源的替代","id":"openskill-与-weng-lin-开源的替代"},{"level":2,"text":"团队评级带来的匹配新难题","id":"团队评级带来的匹配新难题"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"Glicko 与不确定性","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/rating/glicko-uncertainty"},"next":{"title":"队列与分桶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/game-development/game-matchmaking-systems/matching/queue-bucketing"}}